# Docker build context excludes. Docker does NOT honor .gitignore, so without
# this file the entire repo directory is uploaded to the daemon on every build --
# including the gitignored Kiro artifact tree (.code-review can be multiple GB).
# The go-builder stage only needs go.mod/go.sum, the non-test *.go sources, and internal/.

# Kiro skill artifacts (gitignored, but Docker still ships them)
**/.code-review/
**/.judgement/
**/.refactor/
**/.steering-maintenance/

# VCS, CI, and repo metadata
.git/
.github/
.gitignore
.gitattributes
.editorconfig

# Docs and tooling config not consumed by the build
*.md
LICENSE
compose.yaml
cliff.toml
renovate.json
.golangci.yaml
.gremlins.yaml

# Test sources aren't compiled by `go build`; excluding them keeps a test-only
# edit from invalidating the COPY -> go build cache layer. (Revisit if an
# in-build `go test` stage is ever added.)
**/*_test.go
